{
  "id": "samurai-sovereign-blade",
  "name": "Sovereign Blade",
  "classId": "samurai",
  "summary": "In Tian Xia, many samurai are tutored in the ways of honor using lessons that originate from sovereign dragons and their dedication to safeguarding harmony.",
  "replacesText": "Alignment; Mount; Mounted Archer; 6th, 12th, 18th-level bonus feats",
  "mechanicalCoverage": "full",
  "mechanicalNotes": [
    "Dogmatic Denial exposes its exact conditional +2 saving-throw modifier and alignment rule.",
    "Golden Armor spends Resolve, selects one of five energy types, and applies half-level resistance for one round per Samurai level.",
    "Sovereign Breath tracks all daily uses and rolls its half-level caster scaling, sonic damage, cone, and Reflex-half save."
  ],
