          "name": "Sovereign Breath (Sp)",
          "level": 6,
          "type": "archetype",
          "summary": "At 6th level, the sovereign blade can issue forth an immense roar similar to the breath weapon of a sovereign dragon. This functions as dragon’s breathAPG , except it deals sonic damage in a 30-foot cone and has a caster level equal to half the sovereign blade’s samurai level. The sovereign blade can use this ability once per day, plus one additional time per day at 12th and 18th levels. This replaces the bonus feats a samurai gained at 6th, 12th, and 18th level.",
